WEBVTT

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:19.330
<b>A Destructive God Sits Next to Me</b>

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.460
<b>Happy New Year</b>

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:33.280
<b><i>Delusion 10</i></b>

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:32.440
Seri!

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:35.540
We're making our first family 
shrine visit of the year.

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:36.640
Do you want to come?

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:39.240
Nyope.

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:42.590
You should at least get a little exercise.

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:44.880
<i>I'm not going.</i>

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Not a chance in hell!</i>

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:51.580
<i>I can tell you exactly what would happen 
to my peaceful winter break if I did.</i>

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:55.920
<b>Gwaaaah!</b>

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:55.920
<i>I guarantee you I'd hear Hanadori-kun 
screaming in the distance...</i>

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:58.140
<i>Then Tsukimiya-kun would be like, 
"Fancy seeing you here!"</i>

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:01.020
<i>And there's no way in hell 
it'd actually be a coincidence.</i>

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:01.760
Hey! What are you praying for, Seri-kun?

00:02:01.990 --> 00:02:04.500
<i>I just want some peace and quiet
before the new semester starts...</i>

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:07.100
Here, these New Year's cards are for you.

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:10.600
You sure got a lot this year. 
Did you make more friends?

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:12.220
Okay, we're going now.

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:15.770
Why are there so many?

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:18.050
I don't even know that many people...

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:22.870
<b>Miguekoroirya</b>

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:22.870
<b>This year!</b>

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:22.870
<b>Geskoroirya</b>

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:22.870
<b>Let's combine our powers and do 
our best together for world peace!</b>

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:26.410
Gestöber,
Happy New Year! 
Enjoy this brief respite 
before our next round
 of dedly deadly battles. 

00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:26.410
<i>You again?</i>

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:30.790
<b>To Koyuki Seri</b>

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:29.830
<i>Why'd Hanadori-kun send two, anyway?</i>

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:34.340
<i>Don't tell me this whole stack is...</i>

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:34.340
<b>To Koyuki Seri</b>

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:36.420
Nah, surely not.

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:37.280
Gestöber, are you going 
to a shrine after Christmas? 

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:38.700
 I can't wait to shatter
 the darkness with 
you this year! 
Miguel devours my sole 
(? sorry, spelled wrong)
 more each day... 

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:40.180
<b>Making a snowman with Cerberus and Tsukimiya! 
Peace! Hope you can join us next year!</b>

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:42.880
They <i>are</i> all from Hanadori-kun!

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:42.880
Slam

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:48.970
<i>The New Year just started,
and already I'm yelling at him.</i>

00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:51.840
<i>Is this what the whole 
year's going to be like?</i>

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:52.810
<i>Huh?</i>

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:54.650
<i>Here's one from Tsukimiya-kun.</i>

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:55.020
<b>Tsukimiya
Utsugi</b>

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:59.700
"Live as your heart tells 
you this year, Seri-kun.

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:03.460
Whether you're honest with your 
feelings or stupidly stubborn,

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:05.640
try for greatness or live 
like a piece of garbage,

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:08.250
we all end up in the same place."

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:10.200
A dead end, Seri-kun!

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:12.210
<i>Is that how you want to start off the year?!</i>

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:14.700
Jeez! What's with these guys?

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:16.920
Oh, Hibiki-kun sent one, too.

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.430
How nice of him.

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:22.760
<i>Happy New Year, Gestöber-senpai!</i>

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:28.560
<i>But I'm sure a card from me is 
no better than chain mail, right?</i>

00:03:29.110 --> 00:03:33.980
<i>I'm worried just writing to you may 
bestow some kind of curse upon you.</i>

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.420
<i>But I'm sorry...</i>

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:39.540
<i>You've done so much for me, 
and all I can do is repay it with evil...</i>

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:41.480
<i>I'm sorry I'm a grim reaper.</i>

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:44.950
<b>Sorry. 
Really sorry. 
Sorry if you get cursed.</b>

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:44.380
<i>So gloomy...</i>

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:48.420
Okay, moving on!

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:50.750
<b>To Koyuki Seri</b>

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:50.750
<b>From Your Teacher</b>

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:50.740
Hey, the teacher sent me one, too!

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:52.780
I'm sure it just says something stupid.

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:54.460
<i>Happy New Year, Koyuki!</i>

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:55.710
<i>You studying hard?</i>

00:03:56.980 --> 00:04:01.170
<i>I hope you don't get held back this year!</i>

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:03.070
<i>No way! Are my grades that bad?!</i>

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:05.240
<i>Bad enough I'm in danger of getting held back?!</i>

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:07.230
<i>Just kidding! That's a joke!</i>

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:09.640
<i>Not funny! What kind of teacher are you?!</i>

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.560
<i>Oh, no...</i>

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:14.800
<i>It's only New Year's and I'm 
already this mentally exhausted.</i>

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:17.360
<i>I wasn't ready for the New Year at all!</i>

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:24.970
<b>New\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hYear's</b>

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:24.850
<i>If I get held back too, will I be able to 
go on a class trip with Koyukichi-dono?</i>

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:28.520
<i>What the hell? How are you conversing 
with him across time and space?</i>

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:30.410
<b>New\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hYear's</b>

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:30.410
<i>Did you write these together?</i>

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:35.150
<i>I also wish to go on a 
pre-honeymoon with Utsugi-sama.</i>

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:39.200
<i>If we all get held back together, 
I'll have my chance to XXXX him.</i>

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:41.600
<i>Seriously, stop talking to each 
other via my New Year's cards!</i>

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:43.500
<i>You guys are all really close, aren't you?</i>

00:04:43.810 --> 00:04:46.950
Damn it! Did you all have to kick off 
the new year by messing with me?!

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:50.670
I absolutely do not want 
this to be my future!

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:53.600
Kotoko

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:55.600
<i>Is this...</i>

00:04:56.200 --> 00:05:00.190
<i>Happy New Year, Koyuki-kun!</i>

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:03.440
<i>I know it's cold, so I hope you don't get sick.</i>

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.760
<i>This will be our last year in high school.</i>

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:09.380
<i>I hope we end up in the same class!</i>

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:14.320
<i>S-Sumiso-sama! My archangel 
who came for me in the pits of hell!</i>

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:19.770
<b>Amazake</b>

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:24.550
<i>So I ended up visiting the shrine, too.</i>

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.790
<i>The same class as Sumiso-san...</i>

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:29.440
<i>What a wonderful and alluring thought.</i>

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:32.470
Clean-up Duty 

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:34.820
<i>What is this?</i>

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:39.690
<i>With every moment of shy eye contact,
a secret message is shared...</i>

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:43.140
<i>"I love you!"</i>

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:49.200
What are you doing here?!

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:50.440
Visiting the shrine!

00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:52.910
ROFLing at your stupid poem!

00:05:53.140 --> 00:05:55.370
<b>Please mind your manners 
on the shrine grounds. 

00:05:55.370 --> 00:06:00.140
Hanadori was all sad because you 
didn't send him a New Year's card.

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:02.040
Qw-Qwiet! Qwiet!

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:02.720
<i>"Qwiet"?</i>

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:06.410
So I told him that if we came here, 
he'd run into you eventually.

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:08.070
<i>First day of the year, 
and he's already scaring me.</i>

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:11.180
Hanadori worked so hard 
to write all those cards, too.

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:14.560
I was hoping they would bring him 
good luck in the new year somehow.

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:16.520
<i>Yeah, thanks.</i>

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:20.120
<i>I know Hanadori-kun doesn't mean any harm,</i>

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:22.050
Honestly, Hanadori...

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:24.480
<i>but it's clearly because of these two 
that I'm in danger of being held back.</i>

00:06:22.050 --> 00:06:23.090
Qwiet! Qwiet!

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:24.580
You're such a goof, Hanadori.

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:25.820
Qwiet! Qwiet!

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:29.450
<i>I guess I should've asked the gods 
to keep these two away from me.</i>

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:33.930
Seri-kun, are you seriously asking the 
gods to solve your problems for you?

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:36.180
Shouldn't you just try studying first?

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:37.940
That's right, Gestöber.

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:39.920
I'll help you, if you want.

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:42.120
I'm a god myself, after all.

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:44.050
<i>Leave me alone!</i>

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:47.160
Just ask for help, okay?

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:48.620
I'm at the top of our class.

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:49.420
Leave this to me.

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:49.890
<i>Really?</i>

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:51.900
All my grades are better 
than yours, Gestöber.

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:52.460
<i>Die in a fire.</i>

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:53.810
What's giving you the most trouble?

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:54.970
<i>You two!</i>

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:57.050
<i>I want to just study normally!</i>

00:06:57.050 --> 00:06:58.940
<i>But you guys...</i>

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:02.400
<b><u>\h\hGreat Luck\h\h</u> 

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:02.400
I think the first thing you need is a goal.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:04.500
<i>Why</i> are you studying?

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:09.240
Ignoring what's right in front of you, 
your goal is to be a teacher, right?

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.070
Ignoring why you want to do that...

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:16.290
<b><u>\h\hLuck Will Come\h\h</u>

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:13.900
Ignoring whether it's a good idea, 
if that's what you want to do,

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:16.280
then you'll have to deal 
with kids like Hanadori.

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:19.720
So don't run from Hanadori.
 Get closer to him.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:25.460
I think, in part, this will help 
get you closer to your dream.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:28.720
<i>He told me to ignore so much that
I don't even know what he's saying.</i>

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:30.300
What? Why not?

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:32.280
That's not what I want!

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:34.040
Um... Um... I want this one.

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:37.260
Can't you just hand over a really good set
of study notes so I don't get held back?

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:40.400
Oh, no! Your goal is to cheat, Seri-kun?

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:43.120
No. I'm just saying that if 
I can't become a teacher

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:46.500
because I've been goofing off with 
Hanadori-kun, it won't do me any good!

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:47.450
Fwish!

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:51.280
H-Hey! What did you just put in my pocket?

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:53.780
<b>Academic Success</b>

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:55.980
Oh, a good luck charm!

00:07:55.980 --> 00:07:57.620
That sure was nice of Hanadori.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:58.620
<b>Academic Success</b>

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:58.740
<i>Hanadori-ku—</i>

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.580
<b></b>Nothing but misery!

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.580
<b>Terrible Luck</b>

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.200
You can have that, too, Gestöber.

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:08.710
<b>Heh heh</b>

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:08.710
<i>I will kill you, I swear.</i>

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:11.920
<i>Don't give me your own fortune 
when it's bad luck!</i>

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:12.920
Huh?

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:16.840
Hanadori-kun is acting weird...

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:21.230
Seri-kun, this is...

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:22.850
<i>No way!</i>

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:26.020
Listen well, sheeple!

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:29.110
Open your eyes and worship the true god!

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:30.990
<i>He's drunk on amazake?!</i>

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:35.200
I am your god!
Miguel, the dark god of destruction!

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:42.260
I wondered who was making 
all that racket at our shrine.

00:08:42.260 --> 00:08:44.160
So it turned out to be you, Hanadori?

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:45.770
Long time no see.

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:47.260
<i>Gorio-senpai?!</i>

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:52.590
You've got some nerve, causing trouble in 
front of our god on an auspicious day like this.

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:54.900
<i>Gorio-senpai lives here?</i>

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:57.690
I am none other...

00:08:57.690 --> 00:09:00.060
<i>Crap. If this gets any more out of hand...</i>

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:04.160
Hanadori, I think you need
 some help waking up.

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:04.140
Let me go! Let me go!

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:05.500
Let me go!

00:09:04.490 --> 00:09:06.780
Wait! I'm so sorry!

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:09.100
I'll take him home!

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:11.200
Calm down!

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:17.320
Gorio...

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:22.130
Gestöber said to wait!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:22.120
<b>Smack</b>

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:29.000
Hanadori, you little...

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:31.840
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:45.380
Did you see that, Gorio?

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:49.480
That's Gestöber's special move, 
the Stealthy Ninja Blizzardwalk!

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:51.960
It blocks any attack!

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:54.290
See? I'm unharmed!

00:09:55.550 --> 00:09:58.860
Hanadori...

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:00.370
What's wrong, Gestöber?

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:01.780
Why is your face so swollen?

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:05.580
Who made Gestöber so ugly?

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:07.040
Who did it?!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.000
Smack

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.000
You did!

00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:13.590
What's that?

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:14.800
No idea.

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:17.020
It feels like a good omen!

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:22.450
<i>I've shown him pity until now,</i>

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:24.100
<i>but now I'm totally done!</i>

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:27.750
<i>No matter what anyone says, 
I can't hang around Hanadori-kun.</i>

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:29.300
Gestöber!

00:10:29.300 --> 00:10:31.540
Wait, Gestöber!

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:31.230
<b>Grab</b>

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:32.800
What are you do—

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:38.440
Gestöber, I'm... I'm d... d-d-drunk...

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:40.760
H-Hey, don't tell me...

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:42.630
N-No!

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:47.250
RIP
Koyuki

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:47.250
RIP
Koyuki

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:47.250
RIP
Koyuki

00:10:45.780 --> 00:10:50.310
<i>And so, to apologize for 
all the trouble we caused,</i>

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:47.250
RIP
Koyuki

00:10:50.310 --> 00:10:54.550
<i>we spent the rest of winter 
break working at Gorio's shrine.</i>

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:57.020
Damn it all!

00:10:57.020 --> 00:10:59.300
<i>I never did get to study.</i>

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:02.350
<i>What if I really do get held back?</i>

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:07.060
I'm having a surprisingly good 
time learning how the normies live!

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:08.360
Don't worry!

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:11.320
I'll help you study!

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:12.240
<i>Shaddup.</i>

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:14.580
Live as your heart tells you, Seri-kun.

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:16.720
Don't worry, Gestöber!

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:18.890
Shut up and get lost!

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:22.400
<i>Do I not have a prayer this year, either?</i>

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:23.610
<i>Dear God...</i>

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:27.920
<i>It's so warm today...</i>

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:27.920
Koyuki-kun.

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:30.160
About the farewell party...

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:31.650
Koyuki-kun?

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:34.210
Oh, sorry. I was spacing out.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.120
Read this.

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:39.460
<b>Farewell Party Duties List</b>

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:36.840
<i>Farewell party?</i>

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:39.470
<i>That's right. It's the last semester.</i>

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:41.990
<i>Once our upperclassmen graduate,</i>

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:44.320
<i>we'll be in our last year, too...</i>

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:45.940
<i>I need to get my act together.</i>

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:47.880
<i>My last year in high school...</i>

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:49.900
<i>Actually...</i>

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:52.000
<b>Class 2-3\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hKoyuki Seri</b>

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:52.120
<b>Subject\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hScore\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hClass Average</b>

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:54.860
<i>Can I even make it that far?</i>

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:54.860
<b>Modern Lit

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:56.530
<i>There's still time!</i>

00:11:56.530 --> 00:11:58.940
<i>We still have the final exams!</i>

00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:02.970
<i>I hope we end up in the 
same class, Koyuki-kun!</i>

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:06.870
<i>I can't space out now!</i>

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:10.320
<i>This time, I really need to make 
sure nobody gets in my way!</i>

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:14.790
<i>He's spacing out more than me.</i>

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:20.080
Hanadori, Seri-kun, Mogami-kun!
 Let's have lunch!

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:23.250
Hanadori?

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:24.800
<i>Is he dead?</i>

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:29.530
Hey, Hanadori. You said you wanted to 
have buns at the school store, right?

00:12:29.530 --> 00:12:32.770
Once we're third-years, why don't I 
propose that to the student council?

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:45.870
Hey, get it together, Hanadori.

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:49.250
Well, if it isn't Hanadori.

00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:54.300
You'd better not be up to 
something just because

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:57.170
we third-years aren't gonna be 
around to watch you anymore.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:13:00.440
Look, Hanadori! It's Gorio-senpai!

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:17.640
What's his problem?

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:20.590
<i>Hanadori-kun's been weird lately.</i>

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:25.480
But Kabu-dono is always weird.

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:27.730
<i>Well, yeah, but...</i>

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:30.620
He's not even interested in the things 
he'd usually be all excited about.

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:32.450
Did something happen?

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:37.960
<i>It's probably some new way of 
getting me to pay attention to him.</i>

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:40.610
<i>If he's finally being quiet, 
let's just ignore him.</i>

00:13:40.610 --> 00:13:42.820
We have to solve this mystery!

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:44.960
In the name of Gestöber!

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:48.660
Seri-kun, you're the only one 
who can restore him to normal!

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:49.420
Huh?!

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:51.420
First, let's ask around!

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:51.840
Hey!

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:53.010
Koyukichi-dono!

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:56.100
Miguel-senpai's acting weird?

00:13:56.530 --> 00:13:59.380
But Gestöber-senpai, 
you're being even weirder...

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:00.740
<i>I got grabbed by some bad people...</i>

00:14:00.740 --> 00:14:02.710
And thus Detective Seri-kun was born!

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:05.110
You look so smart, Koyukichi-dono!

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:06.450
<i>What are you making me do?!</i>

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:09.590
<i>Why don't you just talk to him 
yourself, Tsukimiya-kun?</i>

00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:11.410
<i>You know this is ridiculous!</i>

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:13.090
That won't do, Seri-kun.

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:16.700
I may be his friend, but that doesn't mean 
I can pry about deep, personal problems.

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:18.540
<i>You do it to me all the time!</i>

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:24.230
So, Hibiki-kun, have you noticed 
anything strange about Hanadori?

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:26.900
Let me think...

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:29.340
Could it be...

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:34.440
My nightly rituals to drive away bad luck
 mistakenly came back upon Miguel-senpai?

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:34.430
Bad luck, bad luck, go away!

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:36.450
<i>You do that every night?</i>

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:40.640
Sturmhut is a knight of the light 
who was invaded by darkness.

00:14:40.640 --> 00:14:43.740
Maybe he tried to absorb 
Hibiki-kun's bad luck for him...

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:45.980
Oh, no! What should I do?

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:48.180
<i>Don't say that. He'll take you seriously!</i>

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:48.940
No!

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:52.050
There's also a possibility that 
Kabu-dono's hair got tangled up

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:54.640
in the straw curse dolls I pound 
into trees every night!

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:56.660
<i>Why the hell do you do that every night?</i>

00:14:56.660 --> 00:15:00.440
Maybe my rivalry with Kabu-dono 
made me do it unconsciously...

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:03.130
<i>Why do you trust yourself so little?</i>

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:04.620
How could I be so cruel?!

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:07.020
That's a terrible thing to do, 
even to Kabu-dono!

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:10.180
Koyukichi-dono, please nail me to a cross!

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:13.320
I'm sorry, Miguel-senpai!

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:16.160
Koyukichi-dono!

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:16.800
Miguel-senpai!

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:17.760
<i>Who are these people?</i>

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:19.120
Koyukichi-dono!

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:19.120
Miguel-senpai!

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:20.780
Hanadori-kun?

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:22.730
I'm afraid I don't know.

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:24.760
I haven't seen him lately.

00:15:24.760 --> 00:15:26.820
Right, of course not. Sorry.

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:32.280
But he must be so happy to have a friend
 like you who really cares about him.

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:36.160
You're so kind, Koyuki-kun!

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:39.040
<i>Sumiso-shan!</i>

00:15:39.860 --> 00:15:41.140
Hanadori?

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:43.630
Does anyone know him better than you two?

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:45.060
<i>Right?</i>

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:47.440
<i>As much as I hate to admit it...</i>

00:15:47.870 --> 00:15:50.100
Maybe his dark destruction isn't going well?

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:52.090
Or someone made fun of him?

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:52.960
Beats me.

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:54.750
<i>I know I'm the one who asked,</i>

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:56.180
<i>but I really don't care.</i>

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:57.210
<i>I want to go home.</i>

00:15:57.210 --> 00:16:02.240
Seri-kun, you didn't complain when 
we were talking to Sumiso-san.

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:04.720
Spring is the season of new 
encounters and farewells.

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:13.980
Perhaps Hanadori Kabuto is concerned about
 his new class in the coming school year.

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:14.990
Mogami-san?

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:18.320
Or perhaps a more permanent farewell...

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:21.780
Maybe his family is moving, 
or fleeing in the night to escape debts.

00:16:21.780 --> 00:16:24.660
In either case, he'd be leaving Mitoya High.

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:27.300
No way. That's too sudden...

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:28.540
If that's the case,

00:16:28.540 --> 00:16:30.970
there are far more pressing 
issues than the farewell party.

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:32.930
Perhaps, anyway.

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:34.840
You <i>are</i> just guessing, right?

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:37.160
Your petty problems aside, 
where is Utsugi-sama?

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:43.230
<i>Damn it.</i>

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:46.340
<i>I never did figure anything out.</i>

00:16:46.340 --> 00:16:47.900
<i>And Tsukimiya-kun vanished, too.</i>

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:51.710
<i>Nothing good comes from hanging with them.</i>

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:53.670
<i>That's why I didn't want to be with—</i>

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:54.110
<i>Huh?</i>

00:16:57.220 --> 00:16:59.900
<i>Hey, that's Hanadori-kun.</i>

00:17:15.190 --> 00:17:18.780
<i>I'm sure it was something really dumb...</i>

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:22.460
<i>But it's rare to see him alone like that.</i>

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:26.060
<i>He's not really transferring, is he?</i>

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:33.360
<i>Maybe he's just upset he won't have any
enemies to fight when the third-years graduate.</i>

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:38.240
<i>Or maybe he's working on some weird 
speech to give at the farewell party...</i>

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:42.370
I'm doing it again! 
This is just what they want!

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:48.840
This may be rude of me to say,

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:53.710
but I don't think Hanadori-kun is the kind 
of guy who can be friends with just anyone.

00:17:54.330 --> 00:17:57.280
Help him out, Koyuki-kun.

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:00.590
<i>If something's bugging him,
 he should just say so.</i>

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:03.220
<i>Like he always does.</i>

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:12.520
Hanadori? Hanadori... Huh?

00:18:12.530 --> 00:18:15.380
Hanadori came to school today, right, Koyuki?

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:16.360
What? Oh, yeah.

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:18.550
Where'd he go?

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:23.820
<i>Hey, remember that Hanadori Kabuto 
kid in our second-year class?</i>

00:18:23.820 --> 00:18:26.140
<i>The dark... something or other?</i>

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:31.380
<i>He transferred schools and couldn't fit in
 or make friends, and because of that, he...</i>

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:35.980
What's wrong, Koyuki?

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:37.330
Uh, nothing...

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:39.700
<i>Wh-What did I just see?</i>

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:40.900
<i>That's horrible!</i>

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:42.560
Seri-kun.

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:44.900
Hanadori is on the roof.

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:48.800
<i>Did Tsukimiya-kun give me that vision?</i>

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:50.060
<i>That's in really bad taste.</i>

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:51.580
Go quickly.

00:18:52.260 --> 00:18:55.720
Before something truly terrible happens.

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:07.040
Hanadori-kun?

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:10.800
Gestöber...

00:19:11.600 --> 00:19:13.020
How did you know I was here?

00:19:13.020 --> 00:19:14.210
What are you doing up here?

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:16.910
<i>He's crying. Don't tell me...</i>

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:19.420
<i>He's really transferring?</i>

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:21.520
H-Hey, listen...

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:24.020
I came to get you for the 
farewell party rehearsal.

00:19:24.020 --> 00:19:25.140
We only have today.

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:26.150
Rehearsal?

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:29.000
I don't have time for that.

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:30.340
What? Why?

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:35.400
Wh-What's wrong?

00:19:38.160 --> 00:19:40.360
If something's bothering you, say it!

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:42.300
You never worry about saying anything else!

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:44.070
But... But...

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:50.120
I'd rather you do that than you keep it 
a secret and make me assume the worst!

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:51.990
What happened? Tell me!

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:55.080
O-Okay, I will, but...

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:56.280
Spit it out!

00:19:56.710 --> 00:20:01.010
Gestöber... When are you going to study?

00:20:01.270 --> 00:20:03.640
You keep saying you will,

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:05.820
but your grades never go up.

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:08.740
You've got bigger problems 
than this farewell party, right?

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:13.480
If you fail your finals, 
you might get held back!

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.650
You'll end up in the same class as Helius!

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:17.370
Gestöber-senpa—

00:20:17.370 --> 00:20:18.940
Oops, you're not my senpai anymore!

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:21.180
He might say that to you!

00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:22.870
Listen to me, Gestöber!

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:24.860
And please don't get angry!

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:27.630
I know you're a hard worker 
and you care about what you do.

00:20:27.630 --> 00:20:30.910
But there's such a thing as priorities!

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:31.950
Look!

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:40.000
Hanadori
Kabuto

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:40.000
XX University

00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:36.350
Even I got an A on the entrance exams 
for the schools you want to go to!

00:20:36.350 --> 00:20:40.010
Even <i>I</i> got an A, but you're flunking!

00:20:40.240 --> 00:20:42.960
I don't want to say this...

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:46.560
But I can't bear to see you 
throwing your life away!

00:20:46.560 --> 00:20:47.390
So...

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:54.370
I've been agonizing over the best way to 
tell you that without hurting your pride!

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.560
My pride is in tatters!

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.560
<b>Shred</b>

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.560
<b>Shred</b>

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.560
<b>Shred</b>

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.560
<b>Shred</b>

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.560
<b>Shred</b>

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.560
<b>Shred</b>

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:57.990
You think you're being nice?!

00:20:57.360 --> 00:21:02.360
But you told me to tell you!

00:20:57.990 --> 00:20:59.640
Whose fault do you think this is?!

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:01.640
You... You...

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:05.940
If only you'd just left me alone to begin with!

00:21:05.940 --> 00:21:07.730
Calm down, Gestöber-senpai!

00:21:07.730 --> 00:21:10.490
Strip me naked, too, Koyukichi-dono!

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:17.040
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:17.040
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:09.930 --> 00:21:17.040
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:10.220 --> 00:21:17.040
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:13.180
Hanadori-kun was literally 
worried to tears about me!

00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:17.040
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:17.040
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:10.890 --> 00:21:17.040
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:17.040
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:11.100 --> 00:21:17.040
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:17.040
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:17.040
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:17.040
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:13.180 --> 00:21:15.700
I'm jumping off the roof!

00:21:16.640 --> 00:21:19.480
<i>And so I kept my head down
 for the farewell party,</i>

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:30.100
<u>Tsukimiya's Special
Learn Math Through
</u><b>Manga</b>

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:30.100
Gestöber
 Level
 English

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:23.280
<i>and thanks to the special study materials 
Hanadori-kun and Tsukimiya-kun gave me,</i>

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:25.320
<i>I managed to not get held back.</i>

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:28.140
<i>I hate to admit it, but this 
is really easy to follow!</i>

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:32.940
<i>Damn it all!</i>

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:09.350
Look!

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:13.960
Hanadori
Kabuto

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:13.960
XX University

00:23:09.350 --> 00:23:13.960
Even I got an A on the entrance exams 
for the schools you want to go to!

00:23:14.420 --> 00:23:18.320
Why's he taking the exams 
for my schools, anyway?

00:23:20.160 --> 00:23:21.920
<b>Shiver</b>

00:23:20.720 --> 00:23:23.820
Don't tell me... Don't tell me...

00:23:26.670 --> 00:23:28.830
No... How could you?

00:23:28.830 --> 00:23:31.920
If you want Amino-san back, 
you'll have to beat me!

00:23:31.920 --> 00:23:33.930
Stop it, both of you!

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:35.200
She's got a point!

00:23:35.200 --> 00:23:35.940
Yeah.

00:23:35.940 --> 00:23:37.930
Our battle is just beginning!

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:38.460
Yeah!

00:23:38.460 --> 00:23:39.980
No!
